UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$Was talking with a bill collector.  During the processing of my payment we chatted about the gospel message. She said she had accepted Jesus  into heart, but her immediate family had not. I told her that I would be praying for her family. In the process I made her 5 minutes late for her staff meeting...she was in the middle of her testimony.  Oh well...I did finalize my payment and repented for making her late. 😆$mojibake$
