UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$A couple of disciples from Jehovah Witness knocked on my door.  I told them that I was reading the Bible. He said more people need to read the Bible.  And so he began with his presentation about hopless times but I said the Bible talks about these times in Matthew, Peter, Thessalonians. So we shouldn't be alarmed.He would start a topic and I would jump in and take the conversation presenting parts of the gospel keeping it relevant to the cross and a covenant relationship with God. He tried to go OT but I rerouted to NT. I said the problem is that people don't fear God. He began but I cut him off and stated that there's a healthy fear and an unhealthy fear of God. I elaborated on that and he began to bring closure. As he was walking I was still talking. 😆  I knew that they were JW before I answered the door and was going to ignore them but I was nudged to engage in the battle. THE END!$mojibake$
  WHERE id = '645e7e82-f24b-4382-a9e7-64fc5edbbeb7' AND notes = $mojibake$A couple of disciples from Jehovah Witness knocked on my door.  I told them that I was reading the Bible. He said more people need to read the Bible.  And so he began with his presentation about hopless times but I said the Bible talks about these times in Matthew, Peter, Thessalonians. So we shouldn't be alarmed.He would start a topic and I would jump in and take the conversation presenting parts of the gospel keeping it relevant to the cross and a covenant relationship with God. He tried to go OT but I rerouted to NT. I said the problem is that people don't fear God. He began but I cut him off and stated that there's a healthy fear and an unhealthy fear of God. I elaborated on that and he began to bring closure. As he was walking I was still talking. üòÜ  I knew that they were JW before I answered the door and was going to ignore them but I was nudged to engage in the battle. THE END!$mojibake$;
