In her own innocent way, she made a relationship with God attainable for this little girl. To God be the glory.$mojibake$;
UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$A coworker had to get his daughter to the ER because she’s been taking her mom’s Percocet. She’s 15. He knew I’ve dealt with my own mental health journey and asked me how he can help her. Through our conversation, I told him “God is good. Even when we’re not.” That comment just led us down a rabbit hole of faith. It was a great conversation. He’s not the most “religious” or “spiritual” person. I won’t say he’s an UNbeliever but he’s definitely not a FIRM believer.$mojibake$
