UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$Today a man named Mr. Harold came over to set up my CPAP machine. While he was setting it up I was talking about my church Reimage. Then he told me his story of how he came to believe in Jesus, and I told him my story. Once he was done I asked him if he needed prayer and he said yes so I prayed for him. After I prayed for him he cried and said thank you. To be honest I cried with him, and after he walked out he stayed in his car for about 10min. So I think he’ll have a great day now.$mojibake$
