UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$1. I shared with my co-worker how the Holy Spirit lead me to prayer for her mental state. She in turn shared how a spike in family concerns / issues was causing her stress. We both acknowledge the faithfulness of God.

2. My oldest son facetimed me to ask about the nature of God. He had some deep questions. His generation vibes relationship with God more than the practice of American Style Christianity. I reiterated the life, death, and resurrection of Jesus as God’s way of experiencing the human plight, and that faith in Jesus gives us direct access to God. He is sorting out for himself living according to the character of Christ as opposed to practicing American style Christianity. I see him as a vanguard of the gospel for his generation.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = '5bd22e48-bb8f-42b3-b698-23b543787843' AND notes = $mojibake$1. I shared with my co-worker how the Holy Spirit lead me to prayer for her mental state. She in turn shared how a spike in family concerns / issues was causing her stress. We both acknowledge the faithfulness of God.

2. My oldest son facetimed me to ask about the nature of God. He had some deep questions. His generation vibes relationship with God more than the practice of American Style Christianity. I reiterated the life, death, and resurrection of Jesus as God‚Äôs way of experiencing the human plight, and that faith in Jesus gives us direct access to God. He is sorting out for himself living according to the character of Christ as opposed to practicing American style Christianity. I see him as a vanguard of the gospel for his generation.$mojibake$;
UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$I was at a restaurant and heard a server tell the server that they have a degree and in youth ministry. I interjected by asking them which institution. The server shared the institution and why they went. They shared with me in brief how as a youth they suffered molestation, being in foster care, and substance abuse. I encouraged them to maintain their relationship with God even in life struggles. I said that it’s better to struggle and have relationship with God than to live without him.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = '8068f767-e2d8-4cb4-9bc3-718224f5a7b3' AND notes = $mojibake$I was at a restaurant and heard a server tell the server that they have a degree and in youth ministry. I interjected by asking them which institution. The server shared the institution and why they went. They shared with me in brief how as a youth they suffered molestation, being in foster care, and substance abuse. I encouraged them to maintain their relationship with God even in life struggles. I said that it‚Äôs better to struggle and have relationship with God than to live without him.$mojibake$;
UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$While having lunch with a friend who is a non-believer, she began asking questions about the Bible. I did a lot of listening, and in the end, I told her that her curiosity was the beginning of something amazing. She and her husband had decided to start reading the Bible together, looking for deeper understanding. She has visited our church before, but I don’t believe her or her husband have ever had a personal experience with Jesus. Definitely think the Holy Spirit is probing the curiosity in her and I’m glad she was comfortable asking me these questions.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = 'ad6c3626-25e0-4efc-baef-d870be80bcca' AND notes = $mojibake$While having lunch with a friend who is a non-believer, she began asking questions about the Bible. I did a lot of listening, and in the end, I told her that her curiosity was the beginning of something amazing. She and her husband had decided to start reading the Bible together, looking for deeper understanding. She has visited our church before, but I don‚Äôt believe her or her husband have ever had a personal experience with Jesus. Definitely think the Holy Spirit is probing the curiosity in her and I‚Äôm glad she was comfortable asking me these questions.$mojibake$;
