UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$As I was out asking for donations for Kare4thelot’s outreach, I asked if anyone needed prayer before I left.  The manager jumped on the opportunity.  After prayer one lady that was kinda of distant spoke up and proclaimed she will reap the harvest God has promised her.  Then as I was leaving they all gave donations.  Another employee wasn’t in the prayer circle so the manager must have told her,  she came out to the truck and I prayed with her as well!! God is moving and I’m so happy to be a part of what he is doing!!$mojibake$
