  WHERE id = '532b05c9-91dd-404a-a281-7a82ea8cf866' AND notes = $mojibake$I finished the day praying for 3 more people.  One lady was at the business for an interview.  I had the opportunity to pray for her,  I prayed for a gentleman Chad, just moved here from Montana, after prayer and words of encouragement  I invited him to church.  The last lady was clearly sick I asked if I could pray for her,  she said that‚Äôs okay but I still said ‚ÄúI pray Gods.blessing over your life‚Äù$mojibake$;
UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$Kare4thelot had a workshop with an after school program with children and their parents.  During the workshop we gave out Kare bags with affirmations on them.  These affirmations include the letter E as a crown on its side.  We use these affirmations to tell the story of Christ and him laying his life down for them.  I was able to share with how much Christ loved them no matter their status or circumstances!  I was also able to tell some of my story to show them how much Christ loved me!  The parents, kiddos and staff sat and listened with open hearts.  The blessing in this was I was told that because it’s a government funded program God or prayer shouldn’t be mentioned but I told them if they wanted us to participate God and His principles are our foundation so He would be mentioned and needless to say we hosted the event!$mojibake$
