UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$This week during our prayer walk through Glen Dale Court the goal was to walk the grounds and pray over the property, but if the opportunity presented itself we (Laneer Peele, Kim Tolbert, and myself) would pray with the residents.  Thank God that door was opened! We were able to have 5 gospel conversations, 2 church invites, and 2 were lead in the sinners prayer.(Robert and Anthony)!!Which both are having issues with their hearts.  After praying with them another resident was watching so we went over to her, she (Cynthia)was actually the older sister of Robert!  After sharing and prayer with her she told us that she remembered us from the hope and wellness fair and just prayed last night to send some encouragement because of the challenges she’s facing and we showed up! It let her know that God hears her.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = 'a62163b1-17bf-45b0-b11f-225b1f77ebb7' AND notes = $mojibake$This week during our prayer walk through Glen Dale Court the goal was to walk the grounds and pray over the property, but if the opportunity presented itself we (Laneer Peele, Kim Tolbert, and myself) would pray with the residents.  Thank God that door was opened! We were able to have 5 gospel conversations, 2 church invites, and 2 were lead in the sinners prayer.(Robert and Anthony)!!Which both are having issues with their hearts.  After praying with them another resident was watching so we went over to her, she (Cynthia)was actually the older sister of Robert!  After sharing and prayer with her she told us that she remembered us from the hope and wellness fair and just prayed last night to send some encouragement because of the challenges she‚Äôs facing and we showed up! It let her know that God hears her.$mojibake$;
UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$My day started with a early morning (7am) visit to Lowes to get supplies for operation lodge😊.  A young man Dionte was walking me to get the items I requested. I noticed his posture after I asked how he was doing, so I quickly said its going to get better.  As the time went on he began to share about his life.  He also shared his concerns about his sister (Shquanna).  After he finished I encouraged him and asked if I could pray for him and his sister,  he welcomed it!! After we prayed he looked at me and said thank you I really needed this today, growing up no one wanted to listen  our conversation continued. He told me he goes to 2 churches because his grandmothers go to different ones and they told him he has to be at both.   After that portion of the conversation I asked he knew Christ for himself not only through his grandmother's prayer? He didn't say yes or no but I encouraged him to make sure he knows him for himself and for him to encourage his sister. The next part of my day was actually a part of the praise report of the 17 children accepting Christ.  After the summer program we (Kare4thelot) desires to give the  participants  tangible items, that can be used in their lives, even after we leave.  With this particular one I desired to include a bible (its a special bible designed to help them understand and be able to share with confidence) for each karebag we give.  (25 bibles in total) This will allow them to continue there walk with Christ and share the word with their family and friends. My heart was ready to but the funds weren't ☺️.  I called around trying locate used bibles but that's not I wanted. (Part 1) I shared with the lady on the phone my desire and what God was doing through us for the community,  she wanted to send a contribution!!!! Before we got off the line she wanted to confirm I received it, and it was more that I expected! (Part 2) I was heading inside the bank and I'm rejoicing and smiling, the teller calls me up and ask good news?, I said yes and began telling her about what God  has done , just did and what He is doing! Then the teller beside her said you are trying to give bibles to children at a summer camp, can I contribute? I gave him the information! (in the bank, during business hours I was able to share the gospel and goodness of God! (Part 3) I left the bank with a full heart tears in my eyes, and rejoicing for that opportunity.  (Part 4) When I got home I was able to purchase all 25 bibles!!! GOD IS SO GOD!!!$mojibake$
