UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$While on my daily walk in the neighborhood ,with lady(my dog), I noticed a small cat struggling to move her newborn kitten. She dropped it in front a lady’s (Joy)door. I have seen and had casual conversations with her. I decided to let her what was happening outside her door.  When she came out she tried to help.  We started talking and she told me she had been crying every day.  She has to have surgery and missing her dog.  I encouraged her and asked if we could pray.  I never got a chance to do this during our walks but this was a great opportunity.  After Jaiven and I prayed with her I offered to help in anyway I could after the surgery.  She thanked us and we assured her that we were right around the corner.$mojibake$
