UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$This week Gods love was made known through Praying and encouraging. Out of the 8 people encountered,  2 were young children.  One of the encounters really  stood out today. As we (Laneer Peele and myself) walked and prayed in the Glen Dale community, one of the ladies we make a point to check on when we are in the area, had surgery last week. As she began telling us about the surgery she told us about knots that had formed in different  areas of her stomach, immediately we laid hands on her and began to pray for a miracle.  After the prayer she mentioned the knots were itching, then she went on to say the doctor said when they start to itch they are healing!!! Prior to the prayer she hadn’t mentioned any itching.  We rejoiced at what God was doing and told her we would be waiting for the testimony of her full healing!$mojibake$
