UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$I am retired from the Military and I share Jesus with former Military friend lives Queens New York upon getting a call from her. She is a Cancer survivor as well and I was Platoon  Sergeant in the Military before I move to NC . She call me and ask how me she would know is God talking to her. My reply how you know in love with someone and she burst out laughing.  I stated to her 3 voices  the Devil in hell Yourself or God thru his Holy Spirit. In closing I share with her 10 victory scriptures on paper with a snap shot via cell and then Pray with her. It took a lot for me to hold myself because I was so Thanksful for the Father in Heaven had done for her Glory to God to the Highest 👋$mojibake$
