  WHERE id = 'b4554627-4744-4e64-ad9b-05a4e6f9e700' AND notes = $mojibake$Shared in the comments of a youtube video (content creator ‚Äúdadlifejason7994‚Äù) where others were stating how they longed for the love of their fathers. I mentioned how I, too, share the same sentiments but have experienced the Ultimate love that none can compare to, the love from my Heavenly Father, God/Savior Jesus Christ. I went into greater details on in the comments of a section but for the sake of keeping this short, I told them that it would have been nice to have a loving relationship with my earthly father, however,  my Heavenly Father God/ Jesus has filled that longing and void.$mojibake$;
