UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$Lead both my nephew Durell and niece Jasmine to Christ and re-shared the Gospel with my nephew Tyshawn. I explained and my niece and nephews (even ones not listed here) through what it means to accept Jesus as Savior and had them to repeat the prayer with me, years ago, when they were younger. Now that the ones here mentioned are at the age of accountability and can fully understand what it means to accept Christ, we revisited the Gospel, what it entailed/Who Jesus is and what He did/ I witnessed 2 of 3 profess/confess that they believe Who Jesus says He is, what He did, and accepted Him as Lord and Savior. Hallelujah, Praise God!🙌🏽🙌🏽🙌🏽🙌🏽🙌🏽😭😭😭😭❤️❤️❤️❤️ Praying that my nephew Tyshawn (who is the 3rd one and is part of a Israelite Group), comes to know and accept the True Biblical Jesus/The One True Living God as Savior.🙏🏽$mojibake$
