UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$I ran into Ricky (on the curb of Dollar General off of Stantonsburg Rd) who I met about a week ago outside of the Ihop parking lot. I asked how he was doing, if he was hungry/thirsty, and asked if he had any prayer requests? He stated that he was fine on food and drink but did have some prayer requests. We prayed and I encouraged him to continue to trust God and reminded him of God’s love and the thoughts He has towards us. Prior to running into him, I saw/met a nice older lady by the name of Brenda. I asked her the same things as I did Ricky and she accepted the goodie bag and too had prayer requests. We prayed and I reminded her of the same things that I expressed to Ricky about God’s amazing love. She said that she does have access to a phone and so we exchanged numbers and I told her to call me of she need someone to talk to or even a prayer request.$mojibake$
