UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$I say a man sitting on a shopping  in the parking lot to the right of Wawa on Memorial Drive. He was with his little dog (her name is Lil Bit). I shared with him that I have a cousin who’s goes by Lil Bit. Well, I asked if he needed help with anything. He said no and that he was just sitting with his dog enjoying the weather. I asked if he knew Jesus and he said, “oh yes mam”, and pulled out his Cross necklace from under his flannel around his neck. And I told him, awesome and that he and I are brothers and sisters in Christ. We chatted a little longer and then I asked if he had any prayer requests and he said no.$mojibake$
