UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$On my way back home to pick up some things for small group I had to stop at Family Dollar on Worthington in Winterville

The young lady at the counter, whose name is Kiana and I don’t know if I’m spelling her name right, was so friendly and she asked me if I was just getting off work and I told her that I was on my way back home for small group so I could you know have a meal ready for them and she was like oh that’s so nice . She asked me about it & told her about itand she was really enthusiastic about it.

I asked her if she needed a prayer for anything and she said she needed prayer for a car and that she would just be kept safe in it once she gets one. So I prayed for her and then I got in my car.  The Holy Spirit say you need to go back and ask her if she wants to come to Reimage Church for a visit.

She just moved to here recently and her grandmother has a church she goes to, but it’s in Bridgeton, which is far for her and since she doesn’t have a car so I gave her my name and number to let her know that she could call me$mojibake$
