UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$The coach at the gym I attend last day was coming up and he’s 23 heading to Durham to get his masters. I asked him if I could pray for him before he left since it was the last time I would see him, and he paused, and I thought maybe he wasn’t comfortable with it however he proceeded to expres what he needed prayer for (he was concerned about finances, his long distance relationship that would be happening once he moved, Is he making right choices, and finding employment while he’s going to school).

The owner and I both prayed for him individually in the middle of the gym as people were walking in. It was everything. Obedience 😉$mojibake$
