UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$One of my team members who I have shared my story with in the past and who I’ve had on my Eye Will statements to talk to them about Christ, asked if he could come to my office to talk to me. He proceeded to let me know that his ex-wife‘s father was shot and killed by a police officer. We talked a little bit about the details, how he was gonna tell his daughter giving his ex-wife grace because of what she’s going through. I said to him well you know we’re gonna pray and he said to me I know that’s why I came to see you. We prayed and talk some more and I encouraged him


One thing he said to me was I know the word says that Gods not gonna give me more than I can bear and I told him actually thats not what that verse means. I explained to him that it’s more about something else in the Bible And that we are always going to have trials, but God will never leave us or forsake us in whatever we’re going through. I encouraged him to look it up, but I’m also going to talk to him and see where he is in his faith this week. 

This man reports directly to me and the fact that he felt safe to come to me and was pretty much asking for Prayer in his own way is amazing. God is working and I asked that you would keep him in prayer. His name is Adrian.$mojibake$
