One thing he said to me was I know the word says that Gods not gonna give me more than I can bear and I told him actually thats not what that verse means. I explained to him that it‚Äôs more about something else in the Bible And that we are always going to have trials, but God will never leave us or forsake us in whatever we‚Äôre going through. I encouraged him to look it up, but I‚Äôm also going to talk to him and see where he is in his faith this week. 

This man reports directly to me and the fact that he felt safe to come to me and was pretty much asking for Prayer in his own way is amazing. God is working and I asked that you would keep him in prayer. His name is Adrian.$mojibake$;
