UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$Shared how the Lord will continually work in and thru you and that salvation is an event and the process  is happening til the day you transition  from the earth    -I told her it is the Spirit of God that changes you from the inside. He will never leave or forsake you even though sometimes it may feel like you are on your own that’s just a trick of the enemy. It’s identity theft.  The work is base on Jesus and what He has already done . We have to believe submit and obey.  It’s ok that you don’t get it right He will Love you any way because He already loved you when we’re an enemy to Him. Stay with Him -He will give you a special joy . Remember it’s is a process of Him working on your mindset . He wants us to be innocent conscience not sin conscience.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = 'b8f4cee1-e01e-4041-8159-f744f8239562' AND notes = $mojibake$Shared how the Lord will continually work in and thru you and that salvation is an event and the process  is happening til the day you transition  from the earth    -I told her it is the Spirit of God that changes you from the inside. He will never leave or forsake you even though sometimes it may feel like you are on your own that‚Äôs just a trick of the enemy. It‚Äôs identity theft.  The work is base on Jesus and what He has already done . We have to believe submit and obey.  It‚Äôs ok that you don‚Äôt get it right He will Love you any way because He already loved you when we‚Äôre an enemy to Him. Stay with Him -He will give you a special joy . Remember it‚Äôs is a process of Him working on your mindset . He wants us to be innocent conscience not sin conscience.$mojibake$;
