UPDATE public.gospel_share_entries SET notes = $mojibake$S-share. I shared my story and how Jesus changed me with Theresa,  a nurse, this morning while running. I noticed she was walking wearing ASICS shoes like me, I said, “nice shoes as I ran went by her on the boardwalk”. She responded, “I am going to wear them for over 150 miles in Portugal. I said, “you mean the St James Walk”? She said “yes”. She has lost 90 pounds preparing for this adventure and plans to lose 60 more. I said, “my daughter is a nurse too.” I shared my story and the gospel. She responded by saying, “ I have been contemplating Jesus , you must have been sent by God”.  The St James walk takes 13 days, I encouraged Theresa that many people walk the St James way in prayer.$mojibake$
  WHERE id = '387c7c7d-6289-464e-92d7-8789f1794a1e' AND notes = $mojibake$S-share. I shared my story and how Jesus changed me with Theresa,  a nurse, this morning while running. I noticed she was walking wearing ASICS shoes like me, I said, ‚Äúnice shoes as I ran went by her on the boardwalk‚Äù. She responded, ‚ÄúI am going to wear them for over 150 miles in Portugal. I said, ‚Äúyou mean the St James Walk‚Äù? She said ‚Äúyes‚Äù. She has lost 90 pounds preparing for this adventure and plans to lose 60 more. I said, ‚Äúmy daughter is a nurse too.‚Äù I shared my story and the gospel. She responded by saying, ‚Äú I have been contemplating Jesus , you must have been sent by God‚Äù.  The St James walk takes 13 days, I encouraged Theresa that many people walk the St James way in prayer.$mojibake$;
